      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAPIDO MYSTIQUE (7) box seated before sticking on well to finish 1.75 lengths away in second (17.52) at Mandurah in a Grade 6 over 300m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Likely to feature again. BINNAWAY CHARM (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.5 lengths away in third (30.23) behind Doongalla Bagger at this track. Will give a great sight again. QUICK LANDS (4) was well in the market last time but only managed fifth (30.40), beaten 4 lengths. Finished third the start before. Should be thereabouts. QUEENIE'S PRIDE (2) placed last time out at this track and distance - worth considering.",
